<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Albertson's raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Albertson's raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney upgraded Albertson's Inc to outperform from neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Albertson's gained 1/2 to 35-3/8.</p>
</text>
